                (\text{kernel\_size}[1] - 1) - 1}{\text{stride}[1]} + 1\right\rfloor

          .. math::
              W_{out} = \left\lfloor\frac{W_{in} + 2 \times \text{padding}[2] - \text{dilation}[2] \times
                (\text{kernel\_size}[2] - 1) - 1}{\text{stride}[2]} + 1\right\rfloor

